Company registry (data/companies.json) seed data:
- LastRound AI ATS company directory (https://github.com/fyrosofttech/lastroundai-hiring-data),
  licensed CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/). Data from LastRound AI,
  https://lastroundai.com/blog/salary-transparency-study-2026. Board slugs and company names
  were taken and re-validated against the live ATS APIs; dead entries were removed.
- Africa ATS Directory (https://github.com/Thelastpoet/africa-ats-directory), MIT License.
  Board slugs, names and sectors were taken and re-validated.

Job listings are fetched at runtime from public sources (Remotive, RemoteOK,
Arbeitnow, Hacker News via the Algolia API, and Greenhouse, Lever, Ashby,
Workable, SmartRecruiters and Recruitee job boards). Listing content belongs to
those sources and the posting employers; RemoteOK requires attribution, so
each RemoteOK listing links back to remoteok.com.
